; The site builds without any dependency's install script, and one of them cannot run here:
; postman-code-generators (pulled in by docusaurus-theme-openapi-docs) shells out to yarn 1 during
; its postinstall, and yarn walks up the tree, finds this workspace's pnpm `packageManager` field
; and refuses to install at all. A clean `npm ci` fails on it; nothing in the built site is missing
; without it.
ignore-scripts=true
